    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know i should check with them but my appointment isn't for like another three weeks and the pain is making it really hard to sleep. is it really that big of a deal? i just need a little relief for the inflammation so i can rest. like if i just take a normal dose of ibuprofen once in a while, is it actually dangerous?",
